1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,450
Stop memorising maths.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,050
Four hundred formulas. The same drill, the same batch, every day.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:07,350
Until the question is new.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,700
Watch the secant become the tangent.

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:14,900
That’s the derivative — not a rule, a reason.

6
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:19,600
Understand one idea, and you can solve what you’ve never seen. Marked like an examiner.

7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:26,400
Class seven to Olympiad. The same mathematics, at different pressures.

8
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,300
Pri Learning. Join the change.
